infographic sequence-roadmap-vertical-plain-text
data
  title Continuous profiling infrastructure: five layers
  desc A 200-service polyglot fleet — eBPF baseline up to cost controls
  sequences
    - label 1 · Collection
      desc eBPF DaemonSet per node covers all languages; pprof / async-profiler / py-spy add allocation + mutex depth
    - label 2 · Backend
      desc Self-hosted Pyroscope 2.0 on S3/GCS — 30-day fine, 90-day downsampled, symbol dedup keeps under 10 GB/service/month
    - label 3 · Trace correlation
      desc Profiles carry trace-id + span-id labels; Grafana links a span to Pyroscope for a sub-30-second drill
    - label 4 · Regression detection
      desc CI diffs a 5-minute canary profile against the prior version; fails on any new top-5 self-CPU function within 1 hour
    - label 5 · Cost controls
      desc Per-service sample rate in service.yaml (99 Hz default, 19 Hz cheap); budget alert at 80% of the monthly ceiling
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
